149 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (SalonSnap is a comprehensive web-based salon management system designed to digitize and streamline salon operations. It provides a seamless platform for customers to book appointments online, make secure payments, and download digital receipts. For salon administrators, it offers a powerful dashboard to manage services, staff, appointments, payments, and customer inquiries. The system eliminates manual booking processes, reduces no-shows through automated reminders, and enhances customer experience with instant payment confirmation and receipt generation. Built using Node.js, MySQL, and Razorpay integration, SalonSnap bridges the gap between customers and salon businesses, making beauty services more accessible, organized, and efficient. The system also supports mobile app integration via Supabase, enabling cross-platform accessibility.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
