153 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (Traditional salon management relies on manual booking systems, phone calls, and walk-ins, leading to issues like double bookings, long waiting times, lost customer records, and inefficient payment tracking. There is no centralized system for managing appointments, staff, services, and payments, resulting in poor customer experience and administrative chaos.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
