155 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (The increasing demand for online services post-COVID-19 and the need for contactless, efficient salon operations motivated us to develop SalonSnap. We aim to digitize salon management, reduce manual workload, and provide customers with a hassle-free booking and payment experience.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
