351 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 117 0 R
/E (SalonSnap successfully delivers a complete, feature-rich salon management system that bridges the gap between customers and salon businesses. The system provides seamless online appointment booking with real-time availability, secure payment processing via Razorpay, automated PDF receipt generation, and a comprehensive admin dashboard for complete operational control. Key achievements include role-based authentication for customers and admins, support for regular and premium services with image carousels, dual payment methods \(online and cash\), JWT-based security with bcrypt password hashing, and a MySQL database with 14+ tables including triggers and audit logs. The system also features email notifications, staff management, customer history tracking, and mobile app integration via Supabase. While security gaps such as unprotected admin APIs and XSS vulnerabilities were identified, these can be mitigated with proper authentication middleware and input sanitization.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
352 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 117 0 R
/E (Future enhancements could include SMS notifications, multi-branch support, loyalty programs, AI-based service recommendations, WhatsApp integration, GST-compliant invoices, staff performance analytics, and inventory management.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
353 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 117 0 R
/E (Overall, SalonSnap transforms traditional salon management into a digital, efficient, and customer-friendly experience, making it ready for real-world deployment with a scalable foundation for future enhancements.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
